nalen, de plakjes knoflook en de chilivlokken toe en bak 2 tot 3 minuten tot de garnalen roze zijn","Serveer op de couscous met het sap van de citroen"],"seasonings":["1/2 tl chilivlokken","{80} ml kokend water","zout"]}}'::jsonb, 202),
  ('l-beef-kofta-wrap', 'Beef Kofta Wrap', 'Spiced beef kofta in a tortilla with yogurt, cucumber, tomato and lettuce', 'lunch', 'beef mince', '🌯', 20, 'quick', 497, 30, 37, 25, 4, 8, 550, '[{"name":"beef mince","amount":120,"unit":"g"},{"name":"tortilla","amount":1,"unit":"","label":"1 tortilla"},{"name":"yogurt","amount":50,"unit":"g"},{"name":"cucumber","amount":60,"unit":"g"},{"name":"tomato","amount":60,"unit":"g"},{"name":"lettuce","amount":30,"unit":"g"}]'::jsonb, '["1 tsp ground cumin","1/2 tsp paprika","1/2 tsp chili flakes","salt"]'::jsonb, '["Mix the beef mince with the cumin, paprika, chili flakes and salt and shape it into {3} short sausages","Fry them in a dry non-stick pan over medium-high heat for 8 minutes, turning, until browned and cooked through","Slice the cucumber and tomato and shred the lettuce","Warm the tortilla, spread with the yogurt, add the kofta and vegetables and roll up"]'::jsonb, '["stovetop"]'::jsonb, '["mediterranean","spicy","quick","light","beef mince","tortilla","yogurt","cucumber","tomato","lettuce","stovetop","lunch"]'::jsonb, '["nut-allergy","halal"]'::jsonb, '{"bg":{"name":"Врап с телешки кюфтенца кофта","description":"Телешка кофта с подправки в тортила с кисело мляко, краставица, домат и маруля","instructions":["Смесете телешката кайма с кимиона, червения пипер, люспите чили и сол и оформете {3} къси продълговати кюфтенца","Запържете ги в сух незалепващ тиган на умерено силен огън за 8 минути, като ги обръщате, докато се зачервят и се сготвят","Нарежете краставицата и домата на резени, а марулята на ивици","Затоплете тортилата, намажете я с киселото мляко, добавете кофтата и зеленчуците и навийте"],"seasonings":["1 ч.л. смлян кимион","1/2 ч.л. червен пипер","1/2 ч.л. люспи чили","сол"]},"nl":{"name":"Wrap met runderkofta","description":"Gekruide runderkofta in een tortilla met yoghurt, komkommer, tomaat en sla","instructions":["Meng het rundergehakt met de komijn, het paprikapoeder, de chilivlokken en zout en vorm er {3} 